      ],
      "assessment": "One model owns one VariationalEquation. open/setArc initializes full-arc state; computeIndices invalidates Alpha once before initial evaluation. getArc returns the same arc without setArc for every block. integrateArc allocates requested rows and visits position then velocity at each original epoch. computeAlpha restarts only on backward indices or invalidation. Blocks cover increasing, nonoverlapping consecutive epochs, so each interval advances once and velocity reuses the position accumulator. Alpha, integrand ring/window, quadrature cache and all original parameter columns survive block boundaries.",
