      ],
      "assessment": "Pulse maps and knot/event integration windows are initialized on the complete arc, not per block. Both position and velocity include initialized pulse columns when epoch >= pulse time; native endpoint pulses at/before first and at/after last remain excluded exactly as in dense evaluation. Density coordinates and boundary lists are unchanged. No new integration cut or state reset is introduced by a storage block.",
      "topic": "Pulses and density knots"
    },
