      "assessment": "Unset/0 selects the original arithmetic body with only declaration hoisting. Canonical integers 1..65536 select blocking; malformed/out-of-range options reject before file/export work after schema generation. The block guard rejects dense reference, covariance query and query reference exports before any block/full design evaluation. Existing segmentedOnly guards reject incompatible outputs before return. Ordinary local segmented export and orbit queries remain supported. The local exporter calls initIntegration before sampling integrands without advancing Alpha, so subsequent blocks start from the same chronological state.",
